# scripts/ is mostly throwaway one-offs, but the scripts that produce
# published figures and numbers have to be in the repository: without them a
# clone cannot regenerate the paper artifacts, which is the same
# reproducibility gap as the unpinned dependencies (CORRECTIONS_2026-07-21, C4).
